      "the base offered rate and integrated burst-average target can be recomputed from the authorized resolved configurations",
      "the raw artifacts preserve source, endpoint-selection, burst and fate evidence for a later E0 load decision",
      "load_selection_rule: after the validity gate (natural_end, conservation, governance and acceptance), label low when delivery_rate >= 0.80 and holding-overflow fraction <= 0.05, medium when delivery_rate >= 0.20 and < 0.80 and holding-overflow fraction <= 0.20, and high for every remaining valid tier that is neither low nor medium",
      "load_selection_rule: holding-overflow fraction is HOLDING_QUEUE_OVERFLOW fate count divided by total offered packets (the sum of all fate counts); a zero denominator invalidates the cell; aggregate each pair conservatively with the lower delivery_rate and higher overflow fraction, and invalidate the tier if either cell fails validity or the duplicate fate counts/primary metric disagree",
      "load_selection_rule: choose the lowest valid medium tier as the provisional E0 candidate; if none qualifies, run a bracket follow-up rather than freezing a load",
